  v1.8.0 (PROD-READINESS-P3-P0-#3 partial): Hindi translations
  for the most user-facing strings. ~30 of the 354 strings in
  values/strings.xml are translated; the rest fall back to
  English (Android's default behaviour when a translation is
  missing for a key).

  The Hindi strings below use the formal register used in
  Hindi-speaking state police / IPS correspondence. Where a
  literal translation would lose meaning (e.g. "deniable
  vault" — kept as "गुप्त वॉल्ट"), the technical term is
  kept as-is in the user's local language.
-->
